# hsm-sim 0.1.0: recall-storm
# Thirty 100 MB files are archived across three tapes and purged. At 01:00:00
# a user asks for twelve of them in an order that hops between tapes. With two
# drives, recalls queue; when a drive starts on a tape it takes every queued
# recall for that tape in one mount, in tape order. Mount and seek time, not
# transfer time, dominate the wait. The 20 % high watermark is so tight
# that some freshly recalled files are purged again minutes later.
# cache 4000 MB, watermarks 20% high / 5% low
# 2 drive(s), 4 tape(s) x 1000 MB, mount 90 s, seek 30 s, 100 MB/s
# scan every 600 s, migrate after 0 s, auto-repack off

